Korri-specific: launch-local core-options overlay, never persisted.

Pinned RetroArch 1.22.2 grounding:
  runloop.c:1082–1238 selects the native game/folder/per-core/custom/global source.
  core_option_manager.c:1114–1124 loads that source before parsing option values.

Apply KORRI_RETROARCH_CORE_OPTIONS_OVERLAY only after native parsing. Retain
each overridden native raw value (including absence) for every exit/menu flush.
With no overlay, native selection, parsing and serialization stay unchanged.

